{"v":2,"catch":"捕捉「ROC」鳥","desc":"《ROC'N ROPE》是KONAMI於1983年推出的動作遊戲。\n為追尋幸運之鳥「鵬鳥」，玩家必須穿越懸崖與冰洞等多種地形不斷攀升。\n運用可斜向上發射的繩索，規劃最安全的攀登路線！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-12-11","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1d35ea81969a8e24a17a6d417a63b658178d767432b5ac65353eec58a5b5110e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d170a78cb55ac68549bd267e3c9395552f5f4aa4412dd8b7b9c0d3a61cc87e31.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3393b4930b8ad9fceb9814b606aa54ca8611ba2c59f0d38ebdace852f483064a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/877a2dbf015d6838893030869ac632521d64f2bc2be008d50f49ea6bb34a1781.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ba61a35da2a2f6890150b9121f488e4eef0ed1cbe0a1ee448e92e247736995b2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/514fe32788e14c2e10c9ffcbb99e8ab532a8459103bdd80c1e37d33cd20ebe65.jpg"],"titleId":"0100933025b60000"}